&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QASIDA AL BADR&lt;/strong&gt; by FAAN — 100 ML&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Step into the night with Qasida Al Badr — a fragrance inspired by the full moon's luminous beauty. This poetic blend of floral and musky notes, anchored by oud and sweet vanilla, embodies mystery and allure. Qasida Al Badr captures the enchanting glow of a midnight sky, perfect for those who revel in elegance and intrigue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fragrance Notes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Top: Bergamot, Nutmeg, Cardamom&lt;br&gt;
Heart: Iris, Sage, Cedarwood&lt;br&gt;
Base: Vetiver, Tonka, Vanilla, Patchouli&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size:&lt;/strong&gt; 100 ML &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Eau de Parfum &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;For:&lt;/strong&gt; Unisex&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Also available:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="/products/qasida-al-badr-200ml"&gt;200 ML&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QASIDA BAKHOUR&lt;/strong&gt; by FAAN — 100 ML&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Infused with the warmth of traditional bakhour, Qasida Bakhour is a journey through the senses. This scent celebrates aromatic resins, exotic woods, and delicate spices for a truly immersive experience. It's more than a fragrance — it's an invitation to the heart of Arabian luxury and heritage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fragrance Notes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Top: Saffron, Clove, Blackcurrant&lt;br&gt;
Heart: Rose, Violet, Incense, Tonka&lt;br&gt;
Base: Sandalwood, Ciste, Leather, Vanilla&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size:&lt;/strong&gt; 100 ML &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Eau de Parfum &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;For:&lt;/strong&gt; Unisex&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Also available:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="/products/qasida-bakhour-200ml"&gt;200 ML&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QASIDA PURITY&lt;/strong&gt; by FAAN — 100 ML&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A fresh and elegant fragrance designed for those who appreciate timeless sophistication. Clean yet warm, it offers a harmonious blend that feels uplifting and refined, leaving a smooth, long-lasting impression suitable for any occasion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fragrance Notes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Top: Pear, Fig Nectar, Lily of the Valley&lt;br&gt;
Heart: Ylang-Ylang Madagascar, Sambac Jasmine Absolute, Tuberose Absolute&lt;br&gt;
Base: Cashmere Musk, Sandalwood Milk, Vanilla&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size:&lt;/strong&gt; 100 ML &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Eau de Parfum &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;For:&lt;/strong&gt; Unisex&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Also available:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="/products/qasida-purity-200ml"&gt;200 ML&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QASIDA QUEEN&lt;/strong&gt; by FAAN — 100 ML&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the throne. Qasida Queen is crafted for the woman who commands every room she enters — a majestic blend of luxurious cherry, exotic spices, and deep patchouli. An ode to royal femininity that gives power, captivates hearts, and leaves an impression of true greatness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It opens with cherry, clove, and pink pepper — bold and immediately distinctive. The heart blooms with orange blossom and jasmine. The base settles into vanilla, amber, patchouli, and coffee — rich, indulgent, and long-lasting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fragrance Notes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Top: Cherry, Clove, Pink Pepper&lt;br&gt;
Heart: Orange Blossom, Jasmine&lt;br&gt;
Base: Vanilla, Amber, Patchouli, Coffee&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size:&lt;/strong&gt; 100 ML &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Eau de Parfum &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;For:&lt;/strong&gt; Women&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Also available:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="/products/qasida-queen-200ml"&gt;200 ML&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QASIDA SENSES&lt;/strong&gt; by FAAN — 100 ML&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A luxurious and captivating feminine fragrance. Jasmine, pear, bergamot, orange essence, and pink pepper open the scent, blending with a rich floral and creamy heart of iris, bourbon vanilla, coconut, damask rose, peony, and lily-of-the-valley. White musk, sandalwood, patchouli, and woody notes create a long-lasting, elegant, and unforgettable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fragrance Notes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Top: Jasmine, Pear, Bergamot, Orange Essence, Pink Pepper, Raspberry, Red Berries&lt;br&gt;
Heart: Bourbon Vanilla, Iris, Fluffy Coconut, Damask Rose, Peony, Lily-of-the-Valley, Mahonial, Petalia&lt;br&gt;
Base: White Musk, Sandalwood, Patchouli, Iris, Woody Notes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size:&lt;/strong&gt; 100 ML &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Eau de Parfum &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;For:&lt;/strong&gt; Women&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Also available:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="/products/qasida-senses-200ml"&gt;200 ML&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
